## SECTION 1 — Entity Making
 PLAYER Model design (note: apply pivot points (PP) to the FOLDER not the part)
Head: 8×8×8 PP = 0x24x0
Body: 8×12×4 PP = 0x24x0
Arms: 4×12×4 PP = left 5x22x0 right -5x22x0
Legs: 4×12×4 PP = left 2x12x0 right -2x12x0
 Model file 
 Texture file 
 Entity file
 Renderer file
 Register entity in ModEntities.java
 Register renderer in ClientModEvents.java
 Register attributes in ModAttributes.java if needed
 Spawn rules (if it should naturally spawn)
 Loot table (if it drops items)
 Sounds (if it has custom sounds)
 Animations/AI (if the entity needs custom behavior)


